row: F-K8S-18
targets: qemu real
profile: ram
feature-sha: da31fd494941d08e
doc: the Dev cluster page of Settings offers Platform services (read only)
clause: 1 Settings > Dev cluster (the sidebar names it Clusters) opens the Platform services panel with the P key
human: platform-wizard | With a k3s cluster running, open Settings, Dev cluster, Platform services, start Deploy to k3s and walk the wizard to the last page without confirming. Expect: Every page fits the window, the cluster choice shows badges and the last page names what would be made.
not-covered: the list with live state, Deploy to k3s, Open, Stop, Start, Upgrade, Backup, Remove, Details, Connect
not-covered: the deploy wizard
not-covered: the assistant tools
not-covered: a real k3s cluster (none in a scratch guest)
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Clusters
click-sidebar Clusters
wait app=Settings page=Clusters
